  {
    "id": "anno-sakurai_lower_p057_left-20",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "寺　四十二人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "寺（てら）　四十二人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Temples: 42. The scan prints a person-counter 人 after the number, which is anomalous for a temple count and which MASTER's raw value drops. The glyph is certainly 人: verified at single-character zoom against four known 人 on this page (the strokes touch at the apex, unlike the separated, splayed 八 of 八百 in the commoner-population column), it is full-size and sits on the same type line as the 人 in the adjacent column, and it falls in the same ink column as 四十二. The figure is nonetheless the temple count, not a headcount: the immediately preceding 佐貫 entry (p. 89) prints the exact parallel 寺　四十七寺 → 人員　七十八人　内　男七十五人　女三人, and here 寺 is likewise followed by its own 人員 五十七人 supplying the temple population. 櫻井's return is loose with counters generally — it also drops the 社 counter on the shrine count above."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "寺"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/lower_p057_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:1227,988,95,578"
      }
    }
